{"created": "2026-11-01T17:05:26.137625+00:00", "modified": "2026-11-01T17:05:26.307591+00:00", "id": 23863311, "conceptrecid": "23736320", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23863311", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23736320", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23863311", "metadata": {"title": "Code and results for \"Not all faults are equal: impact-weighted evaluation of HVAC fault detection with paired fault-free simulations and field experiments\"", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23863311", "publication_date": "2026-11-01", "description": "<p>Python code and derived results accompanying the article &ldquo;Not all faults are equal: impact-weighted evaluation of HVAC fault detection with paired fault-free simulations and field experiments&rdquo;. Using the public LBNL Fault Detection and Diagnostics Datasets, the code derives day-level energy-cost and service penalties for 63 simulated fault scenarios (rooftop unit, chiller plant, boiler plant) from paired faulted/fault-free runs, estimates weather-normalised impacts for 48 experimental fault-days on a real rooftop unit (ORNL), and compares four fault detectors using conventional and impact-weighted metrics (cost- and service-weighted recall, alarm precision on material fault-days). Raw data are not redistributed; see README for download and reproduction steps.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Raszka, Luk\u00e1\u0161", "affiliation": "VSB - Technical University of Ostrava", "orcid": "0009-0005-9443-8015"}, {"name": "Grycz, Ond\u0159ej", "affiliation": "VSB - Technical University of Ostrava", "orcid": "0000-0003-2638-3399"}, {"name": "Vilamov\u00e1, \u0160\u00e1rka", "affiliation": "VSB - Technical University of Ostrava", "orcid": "0000-0002-6486-7995"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 1, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23736320"}}]}}, "title": "Code and results for \"Not all faults are equal: impact-weighted evaluation of HVAC fault detection with paired fault-free simulations and field experiments\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23863311", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23863311?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23863311", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23863311", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23863311", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23736320", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23736320", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23736320", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23736320", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23863311/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23863311/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23863311/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23863311/file-modificatio